<CameraGuide
  lang="en"
  path="insta360/"
  title="Transfer Insta360 Ace Pro 2 videos to Android via USB"
  description="Connect an Insta360 Ace Pro 2 to Android in U-Disk Mode and import MP4 clips and photos to your phone’s gallery with Hikkonuki."
  intro="With an Insta360 Ace Pro 2 and a USB-C data cable, you can save MP4 clips and photos directly to your Android phone. Hikkonuki was tested with the Ace Pro 2. It reads the camera as USB storage without Wi-Fi pairing."
  connection="Turn on the Ace Pro 2, connect it to your phone with a USB-C data cable, and select U-Disk Mode when the camera shows the USB options."
